{"unit_id":"Retr67__dsh-plugin-manager#card-zh","repo":"Retr67/dsh-plugin-manager","commit":"bcefc1165500849c6c1b814fc56248983a66430b","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-plugin-manager 是 DSH Web 插件管理器，在设置的“插件”页面增加管理标签。它通过宿主 HTTP 接口读取运行中的 loader 条目，并对用户插件执行即时启用或停用；分组插件会展开到子条目处理。主要功能包括区分用户插件与只读系统组件、自动刷新或手动刷新页面、将关闭状态写入 profile 并在重启后恢复，以及一键重新启用已关闭插件。适合希望从网页设置集中管理 DSH 插件的用户。运行不需要额外 API 密钥；状态保存在本地 profile 文件中。","source":"generated","evidence":["cordis.patch.yml:4-6","dsh/index.js:188-217","dsh/index.js:298-324","dsh/index.js:355-445","dsh/client.js:245-279"]}
{"unit_id":"Retr67__dsh-plugin-manager#card-en","repo":"Retr67/dsh-plugin-manager","commit":"bcefc1165500849c6c1b814fc56248983a66430b","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-plugin-manager adds a tab to DSH Web settings for listing plugins and toggling managed entries without restarting DSH. It distinguishes user plugins from read-only system components, persists disabled states across restarts, and restores them all at once. Page refresh can be automatic or manual.","source":"generated","evidence":["cordis.patch.yml:4-6","dsh/index.js:188-217","dsh/index.js:298-324","dsh/index.js:355-445","dsh/client.js:245-279"]}
